WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:02.140
<i>Summer break.</i>

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.810
<i>For students studying for entrance exams,
summer is synonymous</i>

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:09.780
<i>not with the beach
or mountains or watermelons.</i>

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:07.770
<i>Get back here!</i>

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:17.160
SAEGUSA SEMINAR
BRING UP YOUR GRADES
WITH OUR SHORT COURSE!

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.530
<i>But with prep schools.</i>

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.660
<i>That's right,
a summer term short course.</i>

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:21.790
<i>As a reward for being a tutor,</i>

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:25.920
<i>the school paid for everything,
so I get to take these courses for free.</i>

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.670
<i>I owe it to the girls for getting
decent end-of-term grades.</i>

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:34.340
<i>And now I'll improve my own grades
with this summer course!</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:35.130
Hey.

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:38.760
My seat is next to yours.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.350
Would you let me get by?

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:44.060
<i>They let middle school students
come here, too?</i>

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:46.810
<i>She's not in elementary school, is she?</i>

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:50.520
What?

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:54.780
Well, this is a class for third-year
high school students,

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.530
so I was just wondering
if you were in the right place.

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:03.370
That school uniform...
You're from Ichinose Academy, aren't you?

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:04.460
That's right.

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:06.580
That means you're my junior.

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:09.290
So be more polite, you jerk.

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.210
PREP SCHOOL STUDENT I.D.

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:13.210
<i>Asumi Kominami, 19!</i>

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:17.010
Nineteen! So she's an alumni
and failed the exam the first time!

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.220
Hey, Junior.

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:21.510
Yes, I'm taking another year to have
a second shot at a national medical school,

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:23.470
but don't ever say that I failed.

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:25.390
It ticks me off
to hear a stranger say that.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:28.100
I'll be careful from now on.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.770
Anyway, if you're going to talk to me,
be more polite.

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:32.530
In fact, don't talk to me!

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:11.080
EPISODE 10:
A LOST LAMB
IN NEW TERRITORY
ENCOUNTERS X

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:10.460
The speed of this class is too fast.

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:11.920
I can't keep up at all.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:17.800
You couldn't get all the notes
for that Japanese history lecture, right?

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:19.670
Um, this is...

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:22.260
That teacher erases the board too quickly.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:25.100
Copy my notes there
before the next class begins.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:44.450
I thought a prep school
was like a magic building,

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:48.080
where your grades would
easily improve just by attending.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.250
Of course it's not like that,
you dumbbell.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:56.540
You go to a prep school
to complement your studies.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:00.300
Don't think it's the be-all end-all, Junior.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:07.220
Well, that's the mistake I made,
which is why I'm here for my second year.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:11.270
Kominami-senpai, you're really cool.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:18.070
I feel like slapping myself for suspecting you
of being a middle school student!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.780
Yeah, why don't I
 help you with that?

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.650
SAEGUSA SEMINAR

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:31.080
<i>I feel like a jerk,
thinking she was still in middle school.</i>

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.410
<i>She got mad at me.</i>

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:37.330
<i>I was going to apologize afterwards,
but she already left.</i>

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:42.170
<i>Huh?
Is the station this way?</i>

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:46.890
<i>Uh-oh. It's my first time in this town,
so I don't know my way around.</i>

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:51.180
<i>It feels like I've gotten lost
in a somewhat dubious area.</i>

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.560
Yo, brother.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.600
It looks like you could use some help.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:00.110
I'll take you where you really want to go.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.820
A place that'll soothe your soul, kiddo.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.950
Um, just the station...

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:10.280
<i>Why?
How did this happen?</i>

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:15.750
<i>I was just heading for the station.</i>

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:21.050
Welcome home, master!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:22.960
U-Um...

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.800
You called, master?

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:32.060
Um, pardon me for asking,
but is this one of those maid cafes?

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:33.560
That's right!

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:36.810
And I'll bet it costs money?

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.560
Of course!

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.030
I'm leaving!

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.110
Huh? Master!

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:49.700
Sorry I'm late!

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:57.000
I'm Pixie Maid Ashumi!

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:01.250
I'll be doing my best, even today, too!

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:07.720
A... Asu...

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.930
J... Jun...

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.810
RUMBLE RUMBLE RUMBLE

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.190
Um, I...

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:20.650
Ashumi-senpai...

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:24.820
Don't call me that, Junior!
I'll tear your head off!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:28.360
I'm sorry! But why are you
working at a maid cafe?

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:31.450
Well, because the money is good.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.700
Nothing more and nothing less.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:38.620
She's working to pay
for prep school and med school tuition.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:39.500
So admirable!

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:43.250
On top of that, she's the most
popular maid here! Incredible!

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:45.710
You don't need to chime in!

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:47.210
And like I always tell you guys,

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:50.550
don't drag people in here
who look like they're broke!

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.680
Sorry, big sister Ashumi!

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:56.220
We had no idea he was your friend!

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:59.350
You guys have to realize
how scary you look!

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:00.940
We're sorry! We're sorry!

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:04.520
They look up to you, huh?

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:09.030
Well, that's just because
I've been working here a long time.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.240
They understand my circumstances here

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:18.620
and I get to study when it's not busy,
like now, so it's pretty convenient for me.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.040
So you can go, Junior.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.540
Right! See you!

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.460
I'm sorry!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.670
Stop!
Just leave them there!

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:33.050
<i>The results of a mock exam?</i>

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:35.300
CHEMISTRY - ANSWER SHEET
PHYSICS - ANSWER SHEET

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.100
This is...

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:40.390
You looked, Junior!

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:49.070
That's right!
I've always been terrible at science!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.400
Want an apology?

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:54.450
I'm sure you're like,
"With your lousy science marks,

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.410
there's no way you can get
into medical school," right?

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.410
Go ahead, laugh!

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.870
Um, Asumi-senpai...

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.840
In other words, for the cylinder
to stay balanced without rotating,

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:12.130
the sum of the momentum
around point C has to be zero.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:14.760
At point A,
the force Na the cylinder absorbs is...

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:19.720
Oh, momentum is the strength
gained by motion.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.560
Y-You made it easy
to understand, you jerk.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:27.150
Junior, you're good at teaching.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.690
Are you leaning towards
becoming a teacher?

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:32.700
I've never thought about it.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:37.490
WELCOME HOME

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.490
THE NEXT DAY

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.500
Hey! Why did you come back, Junior?

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:48.210
I don't really know myself...

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:49.800
U-Um...

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:54.680
We asked him to come over
for free when we weren't busy.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:59.890
With his help, you made
a lot of progress studying, right?

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:04.810
After all, Pixie Maid Ashumi
is the cornerstone of this cafe.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:08.020
We'd be in trouble
if you quit because of low grades.

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.900
That's none of your business!

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:13.740
I can study fine on my own,
without Junior's help!

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.410
DAYS LATER

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:19.660
If you leave the particles as they are,
there are too many and it's inconvenient,

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:21.490
so it's better to group
these 6.02 x 10 to the...

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.200
Yuiga came over today, too.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.620
What a nice guy, especially
when he has his own studying to do.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:29.840
And despite what big sister Ashumi
said in the beginning,

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:32.420
she's obviously getting a lot out of it.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.220
It's getting crowded in here.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:38.010
Oh, sorry.
All right, let's stop here for today.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:40.140
Sure. Well, see you at prep school.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:45.640
Welcome home!
I'm your Pixie Maid Ashumi!

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.480
<i>I'm always amazed by
the lightning fast personality switch.</i>

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.230
TODAY'S TEMPERATURE

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:56.900
<i>All right, now I'd better review myself
for prep school tomorrow.</i>

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.330
Sorry, I was distracted.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:02.620
Are you all right?

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:06.370
No, it's my fault.
I was daydreaming.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.380
Huh? This textbook...

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.040
It's from the prep school
my daughter attends.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:17.590
Hey, Junior!
You forgot your train pass!

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.340
Sorry, Senpai!

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.470
Sheesh, you're so absent-minded!

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.470
That was close.
Thank you so much.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:28.480
Asumi, what are you doing in that outfit?

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:33.270
Dad.

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.030
<i>A worst-case scenario!</i>

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:41.070
KOMINAMI CLINIC

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:44.490
I apologize for the lack of hospitality.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:46.370
You must be surprised
that this place is such a dump.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:47.330
Not at all.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:50.750
<i>So Kominami's family lives
in the back of her father's clinic.</i>

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:56.710
I wanted to make a comfortable clinic
for my patients and got off to a good start,

00:10:57.260 --> 00:11:01.050
but soon learned that my enthusiasm couldn't
make up for my lack of business sense.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.430
It's embarrassing.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.930
But that aside...

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:09.730
Asumi, explain that outlandish outfit!

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.400
<i>As any father would say!</i>

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:15.480
You said you would make money
to pay for prep school yourself,

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:18.360
but don't tell me you have
some indecent part-time job...

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:19.610
N-No!

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.860
Then what is it?

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.990
Th-This is, um...

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:25.030
my boyfriend's interest!

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:25.990
What?

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.040
Boyfriend?

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.000
Is that true?

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.210
What on earth made you
fall in love with my daughter?

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:36.130
Um... Th-That's...

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:43.300
How she works hard every day,
striving to get into medical school, maybe?

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:46.100
Medical school?

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:49.430
Asumi, you haven't given up on that yet?

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.560
Wh-What do you mean, "yet"?

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.690
I'm always telling you that
 you don't need to think about me.

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:57.820
Life isn't only about being a doctor.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:01.200
Instead of trying to force it, just think
seriously about a path that suits you.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.070
I am serious!

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:05.370
I told you that I'm going
to take over the clinic!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.790
Becoming a doctor isn't that easy!

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:10.960
With your science grades,
you won't even get into med school!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.710
We won't know unless I try!

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:15.790
If you can't do it, you can't do it!
You already failed the entrance exam once!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.300
Don't say I failed!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:28.100
Um, I believe there are things
that people just can't do,

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:33.850
but we don't know whether
that "can't" will always be a "can't."

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:38.980
The national medical school exam's
first stage alone covers 12 different subjects.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:41.990
It takes more than a half-hearted will
to take on something this tough,

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.450
to the point of
overcoming your opposition.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:45.490
But...

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:49.490
I'm convinced that Asumi can succeed.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.830
And I'll help her as much as I can.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:55.710
So will you give her just
a little more time to show you?

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.050
I'm sorry, sir!

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:07.300
I really didn't mean to meddle
in someone else's house!

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:09.220
"Sir"?

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:11.140
Call me "Father."

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.640
FATHER-IN-LAW

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:20.980
I guess out of deference to you,
he agreed to wait and see.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.860
Glad to hear it.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:27.870
Since you're my "boyfriend,"
how about a kiss?

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.530
What are you talking about?

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.490
That "boyfriend" business
was just for that situation!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.330
I'm obviously just pulling your leg!

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:36.080
You're a cutie.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:41.300
Well, at any rate,
thank you for what you did back there.

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:44.720
I'm sure I'll continue
to need your help, Junior.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:50.680
What's this? You actually are
hoping for that kiss, Junior?

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.010
You lecher!

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.850
I'm not! And anyway,
you'd better get back to work!

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:58.020
Crap! That's right!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:07.860
Yo, Junior. Are you studying alone
at a family restaurant, too?

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.660
No, actually...

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:10.660
Huh?

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.450
Who's this girl?

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:13.870
An acquaintance of yours, Nariyuki?

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.910
She's adorable!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:20.250
You're so slender!
Are you in middle school?

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.500
Want some udon?

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.550
Which middle school do you go to?

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:26.880
I'm not a middle school student!

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:29.510
Who the hell are you people?
Keep your mitts to yourselves!

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:31.140
A-Ashumi-senpai, calm down!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.930
I told you not to call me that!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.970
I'll rip your head off, Junior!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:40.020
<i>Brother, do you...
do you like maids?</i>

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:40.020
MAIDE CAFE
HIGH STAGE
COUPON

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.650
SAEGUSA SEMINAR

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.110
You guys have summer seminar from today?

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:49.200
We're taking different courses,
though, so we're in different classrooms.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:54.450
We figured we can't just
rely on you all the time, Nariyuki.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.830
The three of us decided together.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.040
My relationship with them?

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:03.880
Oh, due to circumstances,
I'm kind of tutoring them.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.460
Tutoring, huh?

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:12.050
I didn't expect them to take a summer course
on their own to tackle their weaknesses.

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:15.060
Somewhere along the line,
they've become real troopers.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:18.520
Maybe I'll be relieved
of my duties before long.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.060
Is that right?

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:21.060
LUNCH BREAK

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.230
Oh no, no, no!

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:28.320
The pace of the class is so fast I can't pick up
one picometer of what the teacher is saying!

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:29.320
NEXT BREAK

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:31.110
I-I-I-I...

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:38.330
I-I think Japanese people should just
take pride in Japanese alone and stick with it!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:39.290
AND THE NEXT BREAK

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:40.830
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.630
Slap me as hard as you can!

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:47.920
Waves of equations are lulling me
towards the abyss of sleep!

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:49.760
Go on, do it!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.090
The pace of class is too fast.

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.470
I just can't keep up.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:59.310
The teacher erases the board too quickly.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:04.100
You've all survived the trial by fire
that is the first day of prep school.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.900
I was the same way.

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:11.240
Even though I reviewed
this textbook before coming...

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:14.780
Prep school teaching materials
aren't really suitable for studying at home.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:18.700
They're created to be used
in the prep school class alone.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:22.620
To study alone, you'd be better off
with over-the-counter books and workbooks.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:27.250
Of course, studying
with reference books alone is inadequate.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:33.550
If you focus on self-study, you'll be able
to get better results at prep school.

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:36.720
Well, that's just my opinion.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.390
Wh-What?

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:43.270
Kominami-senpai, you're so cool!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.440
N-Now quit pestering me!

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:49.320
<i>She doesn't seem as annoyed...</i>

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.320
AKAHORI BOOKS

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:53.030
So if you study hard with
the reference books I just told you,

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:55.110
you should be able
to get a firm grasp of the basics.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:56.530
Thank you!

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:59.540
<i>When all is said and done,
she's like a mother hen.</i>

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:02.750
It looks like it's going to rain,
so I'm taking off.

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:11.920
This is what they call tor... tor...
tor-tor-tor... What is it again?

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:13.840
Tarantula rain, Takemoto!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.090
It's torrential rain!

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:17.640
More importantly,
we need to take cover!

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.180
KOMINAMI CLINIC

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:23.020
Damn, that was really horrible.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.810
Ugh, I'm soaked.

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:28.360
I'm sorry, Asumi-senpai.

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:30.520
You let us into your home
and even let us borrow towels...

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:35.570
You're a lifesaver!

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:39.660
D-Don't look at me!

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:42.120
Idiot!
You've got a dirty mind, Nariyuki!

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:44.040
I-I'm sorry, Takemoto!

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:48.000
<i>He saw it.
That's not weird, is it?</i>

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:50.750
<i>It's the bra that clerk recommended.</i>

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:54.340
<i>And I've been wondering
what Nariyuki would think about it.</i>

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:58.300
<i>Dummy! If I ask him that now,
he'll think I have a dirty mind!</i>

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.390
<i>Takemoto is wearing the bra I chose!</i>

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.520
<i>Don't think about it!
Don't think about it!</i>

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.680
<i>I'm really sorry, Takemoto!</i>

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:10.560
EXAMINING ROOM

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.730
Um, thank you for the towel.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.560
It made all the difference.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:16.150
Not at all. It's rare for my daughter
to bring friends over, so I'm delighted.

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:19.160
The important thing is for you kids
to stay healthy before exams.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:24.580
By the way,
are you all friends of Yuiga?

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:28.540
Yes. He's always helping us out.
It's like he's our benefactor.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:30.380
Oh, I see.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:33.460
Then he is a good man after all.

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:35.840
I agree!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:39.890
<i>When Yuiga is praised,
it makes me feel good too!</i>

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:46.350
I'm glad the first boyfriend my daughter
has brought home is a fine young man.

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.820
Plum kelp tea is yummy!

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:54.780
Just plum delicious.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:03.160
What's wrong, Furuhashi?

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:10.000
Would you fill me in
about being Kominami-senpai's boyfriend?

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:15.710
What? It's a lie?

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.590
Why would you lie about that?

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:20.090
<i>That's a very good question.</i>

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:23.300
Well... I can't really say.

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:26.560
Oh? In that case...

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.850
I asked him to lie for me.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.690
K-Kominami-senpai!

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:35.150
Why are you guys sneaking around
in my hallway?

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:39.150
Circumstances dictated
pulling the wool over my dad's eyes.

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:41.410
All he did was play along.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.700
It's not Junior's fault.

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:50.790
Then you don't especially have
feelings like that for Yuiga.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:54.210
Oh, I wouldn't say that.

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:55.960
He's pretty cute.

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:00.720
Just kidding.

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:03.890
I told you before
to stop joking around like that!

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:06.600
Don't be so serious all the time.

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:09.020
And Furuhashi, is it?

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.060
Since you asked me about it...

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:16.320
you're the one who must have
"feelings like that" for him.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.690
RUMBLE RUMBLE RUMBLE RUMBLE

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:21.860
You're way off-base.

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:23.740
Really?

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.990
Okay, if you say so.

00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:13.020
<i>Jeez, I really wish she'd stop
kidding around about that.</i>

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:15.140
<i>It's bad for my heart!</i>

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:22.780
<i>To be honest, she looks so young
that I didn't notice how beautiful she is.</i>

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:27.780
So, Junior, which one of them
are you crushing on?

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:30.410
Why would you even ask me that?

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:33.040
Romance is forbidden
when you're studying for entrance exams.

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:36.330
Besides, that kind of question
is rude to them, too.

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:39.830
Then what are you going to do
after entrance exams are over?

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:43.590
<i>When entrance exams are over...</i>

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:48.840
<i>I've been so focused
on the recommendation and their choices...</i>

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:51.680
<i>that I haven't even thought about it.</i>

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:53.930
Here.

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:56.730
On the house.

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:58.230
Come on, scoot over.

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:02.110
Just this one time.

00:23:02.150 --> 00:23:05.190
Normally I don't do this unless I get paid.

00:23:07.400 --> 00:23:12.160
Our "lie"... What would you do
if I said it wasn't a lie?

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:15.450
Don't you want to know?

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:20.250
My true feelings...

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:28.760
YOU DAMN WOMANIZER

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:31.680
Is it to your liking, Master?

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:33.720
Like I'm going to eat it!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:39.600
Next time:
An Illustrious Veteran Sometimes Serves X.

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:39.980
NEXT EPISODE: AN ILLUSTRIOUS VETERAN
SOMETIMES SERVES X
